Mechanism model proposed for the regulation of H2A ubiquitination on the function of FACT on nucleosomes. (
A
) H2A ubiquitination stabilizes the nucleosome and inhibits the binding of FACT to completely block the remodeling effect of FACT to repress gene transcription. (
B
